---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Tata Cara Wudhu - Bilik Tafakur">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto py-4 animate-fade-in">
        <div class="mb-8 flex items-center justify-between">
            <a href="/fikih" class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:scale-105 transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
                DAFTAR FIKIH
            </a>
        </div>

        <article class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-xl overflow-hidden">
            <div class="bg-emerald-50/50 dark:bg-emerald-900/20 px-8 py-6 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 text-center">
                <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-poppins font-bold text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-400">Tata Cara Wudhu</h1>
            </div>

            <div class="p-8 md:p-10 space-y-10">
                <div class="text-right">
                    <p class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-50 leading-relaxed">نَوَيْتُ الْوُضُوءَ لِرَفْعِ الْحَدَثِ الْأَصْغَرِ فَرْضًا لِلَّهِ تَعَالَى</p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-6">
                    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
                        <p>Wudhu adalah salah satu cara mensucikan anggota tubuh dengan air. Seorang muslim wajib bersuci setiap akan melaksanakan shalat.</p>
                        
                        <h3>Urutan Wudhu:</h3>
                        <ol>
                            <li>Niat & Membasuh tangan</li>
                            <li>Berkumur...</li>
                        </ol>
                        
                        </div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-amber-50/50 dark:bg-amber-900/10 p-6 rounded-3xl border border-amber-200/50 text-sm italic">
                    <p><strong>Dasar Hukum:</strong> Berdasarkan QS. Al-Ma'idah ayat 6...</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </article>
    </div>
</MainLayout>
